    {
      "id": "1320433092518871100",
      "type": "Default",
      "timestamp": "2024-12-22T16:49:41.717+00:00",
      "timestampEdited": null,
      "callEndedTimestamp": null,
      "isPinned": false,
      "content": "```Kanta Hame is a figure that, if you haven't heard of, you haven't learned the full history of TEP's ally 10000 Islands. His military prowess and contributions to the defender cause cannot be understated, and are well articulated by Rhaza in the resolution, a prominent defender figure who can speak with authority on the true impact of Kanta Hame's career in terms of recruitment, training, intelligence, and operations themselves. It takes a strong nominee to fill an entire commendation with only R/D accomplishments, and the chosen accomplishments are worth all the praise they are receiving. For these reasons, TEP recommends a vote FOR this resolution.```",
      "author": {
        "id": "738186404399415336",
        "name": "theconstantofchange",
